2026-07-27T10:06:23.1485431Z i /tmp/RtmpwQtnOP/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1485782Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1486200Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1486598Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1487175Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1488048Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:06:23.1489067Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
